#   By Eucharitid                                               ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀  ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
# 360p conversion by rockbox-y1

#__SBS File

#__Hide the status bar
%wd

#__Disable Title
%?Lt<|>

#__Backdrop (1-bit bmp on the backdrop layer, recoloured by the theme)
%xl(RatPod,RatPod.bmp,0,0)
%V(0,0,-,-,-)%VB
%xd(RatPod)
%V(0,0,-,-,-)

#__Preload fonts
%Fl(3,14-LanaPixel.fnt)
%Fl(4,14-LanaPixel.fnt)

#__Preload images
%xl(PBI,Playback_Icons.bmp,5)
%xl(H,BatteryStatus.bmp,12)
%xl(PBB,pb_back.bmp,0,0)
%xl(PB,pb.bmp,0,0)
%xl(VBB,vb_back.bmp,0,0)
%xl(VB,vb.bmp,0,0)

#__Quickscreen Images
%xl(Slider,Slider.bmp,0,0)
%xl(SliderBack,QuickSliderBack.bmp,0,0)
%xl(BrightnessIcons,QuickBrightness.bmp,0,0)
%xl(VolumeIcons,VolumeIcons.bmp,4)

#------------- Status Bar Layer -----------#

#__Battery Text
%V(360,21,53,30,3)
%ar%bl%%

#__Battery Icon
%V(422,26,31,16,-)
%?bp<%xd(Hl)|%?bl<%xd(Ha)|%xd(Hb)|%xd(Hc)|%xd(Hd)|%xd(He)|%xd(Hf)|%xd(Hg)|%xd(Hh)|%xd(Hi)|%xd(Hj)|%xd(Hk)>>

#__Volume Text / LOCKED on hold
%V(332,51,120,47,3)
%ar%?mh<LOCKED|Vol. %pv dB>

#------------ Main Screen Layer -----------#

#__USB Screen
%?if(%cs, =, 21)<%VI(clearScreen)%Vd(USB)|%VI(menuViewport)%Vd(MainDisplay)>

#__Clear Screen
%Vi(clearScreen,0,0,2,2,-)

#__Volume Bar
%Vl(MainDisplay,30,86,420,1,-)
%pv(0,0,420,1,VB,backdrop,VBB)

#__UI Viewport
%Vi(menuViewport,30,104,420,180,4)

#__Track Progress Bar
%Vl(MainDisplay,30,291,420,2,-)
%dr(0,0,420,2)
%Vl(MainDisplay,30,293,420,7,-)
%pb(0,0,420,7,PBB,slider,PB)
%Vl(MainDisplay,30,300,420,2,-)
%dr(0,0,420,2)

#__Play/Pause Icons
%Vl(MainDisplay,30,321,32,17,-)
%?mp<%xd(PBI,1)|%xd(PBI,2)|%xd(PBI,3)|%xd(PBI,4)|%xd(PBI,5)>

#__Now Playing
%Vl(MainDisplay,65,317,292,30,3)
%al%s%?ia<%ia - %it|%fn>

#----------- Quick Screen Layer -----------#

#__Clear Screen
%V(0,0,0,0,-)

#__Quick Screen Default Location
%?if(%cs, =, 10)<%Vd(Quickscreen)%VI(QuickDefault)>

#__Quick Screen Sliders
%Vl(Quickscreen,39,111,24,21,-)
%?if(%pv, =, -90)<%xd(VolumeIcons,1)>
%?and(%if(%pv, <=, -60),%if(%pv, >, -90))<%xd(VolumeIcons,2)>
%?and(%if(%pv, <=, -30),%if(%pv, >, -60))<%xd(VolumeIcons,3)>
%?if(%pv, >, -30)<%xd(VolumeIcons,4)>
%Vl(Quickscreen,72,113,369,18,-)%pv(0,0,369,18,Slider,backdrop,SliderBack)
%Vl(Quickscreen,39,146,39,40,-)%xd(BrightnessIcons,1)
%Vl(Quickscreen,72,149,369,18,-)%St(0,0,369,18,Slider,backdrop,SliderBack,setting,brightness)

#__Default Quickscreen
%Vi(QuickDefault,23,176,433,105,3)

#---------------  USB Layer ---------------#

#__USB
%?if(%cs, =, 21)<%Vd(USB)>

#__USB Text
%Vl(USB,30,135,420,45,4)
%acUSB CONNECTED%Vs(invert)

#__USB Line Top
%Vl(USB,30,86,420,1,-)
%dr(0,0,420,1)

#__USB Line Bottom
%Vl(USB,30,300,420,2,-)
%dr(0,0,420,2)

#__USB Eject Warning
%Vl(USB,45,195,390,30,3)
%ac%t(1)! EJECT BEFORE DISCONNECTING !;%t(.1)%ac
